IOS_EXIT=65 — DIAGNOSIS: jetsam (OS memory-pressure killer) under shared-runner contention
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The runner is a 64GB Mac shared by a mass-parallel slot harness; up to FOUR concurrent
`xcodebuild` processes and 40+ concurrent `swift-frontend` processes were observed. The
whole-module emit of the 1495-file TeslaSync app target needs ~8.8GB as a SINGLE process;
when several slots hit that peak together the OS jetsam killer SIGKILLs compiles.

